***conformance tests***

# path-order
With `tests/b.plain`, `tests/a.plain` and `tests/sub/c.plain` all bound to `todo:add-task`, the bound files are `tests/a.plain`, `tests/b.plain`, `tests/sub/c.plain`.

# folder-order
With the tests folders [`more`, `tests`], `more/b.plain` and `tests/a.plain` are bound in that order.

# missing-folder
Without a `tests` directory, no file is bound.

***acceptance tests***
